# Isabelle: The Isabelle/Isar Reference Manual (Isabelle2024); requirements/languages/isabelle.md
name     isabelle thy
keyword  theory imports begin end definition fun primrec function lemma theorem corollary proof qed
keyword  by apply done using unfolding assume show have hence thus fix obtain where and datatype
keyword  record locale context interpretation inductive abbreviation notation
builtin  auto simp blast force induction cases rule arith fastforce metis True False
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
string   ‹ ›
string   ` `
operators  +-*/=<>:|!&?.
